Dual License Notice
====================

This repository contains both software and written content, licensed
under two different licenses appropriate to their nature.

  - Software (Python code, configuration, scripts) is licensed under
    the Apache License 2.0. See LICENSE-CODE for the full text.

  - Written content (Working Paper, README files, documents in
    archive/, and all other textual material) is licensed under the
    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY 4.0).
    See LICENSE-PAPER for the full text.

When in doubt about which license applies to a given file: source
files (.py, .sh, .yaml, .json, .toml, requirements.txt) follow
LICENSE-CODE; documentation and prose (.md, .txt, /paper/) follow
LICENSE-PAPER.

Both licenses require attribution. Neither license grants exclusive
rights over the underlying ideas or architectural patterns described
in this repository; they protect the specific expression and code,
not the concepts.

